    "notes": "Weighed PHASE_0.1_ASSY scenario requested 2026-09-15. Foil deflections by motor are exactly 0=50, 1=50, 2=55, 3=55, 4=60, 5=60, 6=65, 7=65 deg; hover pitch is 26 deg. The two centreline/front fans tilt sideways only: fan 8 is 30 deg right (tilt 30, azimuth 90; axis [0,+0.5,-0.866]), fan 9 is 30 deg left (tilt 30, azimuth 270; axis [0,-0.5,-0.866]); neither has any fore/aft axis component. Mass/inertia and CAD come from atlas_weighed_p26_side30. Tuned in eight interactive SITL hover flights on 2026-09-15. Gazebo retains the full physical sideways lean; PX4 models 20 percent of its lateral component with CA_ROTOR8/9_AY=+0.10/-0.10 and CT=29.03 N. This equalized the physical front-fan commands while preserving allocator torque delivery. The selected horizontal loop is MPC_XY_VEL P/I/D=0.85/0.07/0.55 and MPC_XY_P=0.65; MC_YAWRATE_I=0.12. The selected 55 s flight had 0.59 m horizontal drift, 2.31/1.24/4.33 deg roll/pitch/yaw peak-to-peak during settling, 0.075 m altitude standard deviation and no actuator saturation. | Landing gear added: parks at -20 deg pitch on four legs (front pair x +0.50 y \u00b10.06, rear pair x -0.30 y \u00b10.40 m FRD), 0.05 m skin clearance.",
